# Backend: apps/ai-app

AI Food does **not** contain its own AI backend. The gateway lives at:

`apps/ai-app` (npm package `openrouter-gateway`)

- Express proxy → OpenRouter (`OPENROUTER_API_KEY` server-side)
- Client uses `VITE_AI_GATEWAY_URL` + `VITE_AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY`
- **Food AI:** `POST /v1/food/analyze` (SSE), `/v1/food/refine`, `/v1/food/ask` (JSON) — prompts, `OPENROUTER_MODEL`, temperature `0`, and `messages[]` live in `apps/ai-app` (`src/food/*` + `routes/food.ts`)
- **Client keeps:** image compress, XML/JSON response parse, UX; clean bodies only (no `model` / `messages` / `temperature` / system prompts)
- **Generic proxy:** `POST /v1/chat/completions` remains for other callers (e.g. onboarding micronutrients)
- **User-data sync (logged-in):** `POST /user/meals|weights|favorites|settings/sync` + nutrition profile (incl. micronutrientTargets) — see `apps/ai-food/docs/USER-DATA-SYNC.md`. **Meal photo blobs stay on device forever** (URI stubs only on the wire).
- Full contract: `apps/ai-food/docs/AI-GATEWAY.md`

## Env (не смешивать)

| App | Файл | Примеры |
|-----|------|---------|
| Gateway | `apps/ai-app/.env` | `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`, `OPENROUTER_MODEL`, `API_KEY`, `DATABASE_URL`, `AUTH_SECRET`, `TBANK_*` |
| Frontend | `apps/ai-food/.env` | только `VITE_*` (`VITE_AI_GATEWAY_URL`, `VITE_AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY`, …) |

Секреты бэка никогда не в `VITE_*`. Локально: `pnpm dev` из корня (или `dev:app` + `dev:food`).

Do not look for in-repo `/analyze-food` mock server — removed. Gateway + food prompts/params → `apps/ai-app`; analysis UX / compress / parse → `apps/ai-food`.
